<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="row" id="problem">
      <h2 class="row-title">The problem</h2>
      <div class="row-body">
        <p class="lead">Standard talks lose the room and are forgotten fast. Our sessions are participatory: the audience is active, and leaves with one clear message.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row" id="what">
      <h2 class="row-title">What you can book</h2>
      <div class="row-body">
        <ul class="terms">
          <li><strong>Keynote.</strong> A conference opener or closer the audience joins.</li>
          <li><strong>Energiser.</strong> Ten minutes that get a tired room up and moving to one original song. One price, on the <a href="/event-interludes/">Sci Pop Energiser</a> page.</li>
          <li><strong>Workshop.</strong> Research communication, STEAM, or creative thinking for teams.</li>
          <li><strong>Performance.</strong> A live sci pop set built around your theme.</li>
          <li><strong>School incursion.</strong> A science, music and movement session for a class, a year level or a whole school.</li>
          <li><strong>Science-art residency.</strong> A short embedded stay, making work with your researchers or your community.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Our two signature workshops, How To Lead a Diverse Team Into Belonging and How To Turn Your Knowledge Into Art That Connects, are set out in full on our <a href="https://drweli.com/program/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">programs page</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row" id="how">
      <h2 class="row-title">How it runs</h2>
      <div class="row-body">
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>Open with a short group movement.</li>
          <li>Introduce the idea and its human angle.</li>
          <li>Translate it into song, story or movement.</li>
          <li>Run a group activity.</li>
          <li>Close on one clear message.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row" id="why">
      <h2 class="row-title">Why you need us</h2>
      <div class="row-body">
        <p>Delivered by Dr WELI, an evolutionary ecologist (PhD, ANU) and recording artist. The work mixes worlds that rarely meet: science, universities and the commercial creative industries. Your audience leaves with the creative potential in scientific thinking made obvious, and with a wider sense of what a career in science can look like. The method has run from school classrooms to conference plenaries. AAAS Dance Your PhD Overall Winner 2024; 238+ media features across five continents.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row" id="who">
      <h2 class="row-title">Who it is for</h2>
      <div class="row-body">
        <p>Conference producers and event organisers. People-and-culture and L&amp;D teams. University researcher-development and engagement teams. Festival and science-week programmers. Schools. NGOs and community events.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section dark" id="book" aria-labelledby="book-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="row">
      <h2 class="row-title" id="book-title">Book us live</h2>
      <div class="row-body">
        <p>One offer has one price. Everything else is shaped to your brief:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>The <a href="/event-interludes/">Sci Pop Energiser</a>: about 10 minutes, A$1,200.</li>
          <li>School sessions from about $549 a session, through <a href="/kt-kids/">Kangaroo Time Kids</a>.</li>
          <li>Keynotes, workshops and performances: open to discuss.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="soft">Tell us your audience and the moment in your program, and we send a fixed quote within two working days.</p>
        <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="mailto:hello@wildwoohoo.com?subject=Book%20us%20live">Bring us to your event</a></div>
        <p class="soft" style="margin-top:28px;font-size:.875rem">Want to book WELI as an individual speaker? See <a href="https://drweli.com/program/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">drweli.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
